# Guidelines : 
# To install this repository, 'vcstool' is required. To install it, use the following command : sudo apt install python3-vcstool
# To clone the above repositories, use the following command : vcs import < dependencies.repos
# To install all dependencies, use the following command : rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y
# Then use colcon to build the workspace : colcon build --symlink-install

# Note to developer : Split the dependencies.repos file into multiple files if the number of repositories exceeds 5 for better readability and maintenance.
